  "body_html": "<p>Embrace your love for baseball with this personalized baseball comforter set from Jeminise. Perfect for baseball players, fans, and lovers, this bedding set combines comfort with a unique, custom design, making it an ideal gift for any occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Designed for baseball enthusiasts, celebrating determination and passion for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin, Full, Queen, and King sizes to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features an environmental protection finishing process for vibrant, fade-resistant colors and smooth, compact stitching for lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling, ensuring a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight sleeping experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and dries quickly for convenient maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your name for a unique touch, making it a truly special bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover, perfect for refreshing your bedroom decor.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Set Name</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
